  "gameRulesAllJudgesBody": "Optional with a phone for everyone: each person sorts the entire group and drinks only for errors in their own order.",
  "gameRulesRotationTitle": "Changing judges and questions",
  "gameRulesRotationBody": "After a completed case, the next person in seating order becomes judge. With physical cards, manage this at the table. Replacing a question stays within the same case: judge, secret numbers, case count and rule schedule remain unchanged. Shown questions are not drawn again in the same game. Once the first digital number is revealed publicly, the question can no longer be replaced.",
